=== IR BEFORE OPTIMIZATIONS ===
0000: CMP P0,#0
0001: T0 <-- (cond=0x95)
0002: RETURNVALUE T0
=== END IR BEFORE OPTIMIZATIONS ===
=== IR AFTER LOOP ROTATION ===
0000: CMP P0,#0
0001: T0 <-- (cond=0x95)
0002: RETURNVALUE T0
=== END IR AFTER LOOP ROTATION ===
=== IR AFTER OPTIMIZATIONS ===
0000: CMP R0(P0),#0
0001: R0(T0) <-- (cond=0x95)
0002: RETURNVALUE R0(T0)
=== END IR AFTER OPTIMIZATIONS ===
